y:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="48343c2b-28de-4dd6-a9e4-1f9a7bd1fcf1" data-testid="conversation-turn-2" data-scroll-anchor="false" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT Plus</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d76c390b-f523-4d8b-ac81-66ef03cb0a58" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="62">Bien. Lo que estás viendo <strong data-start="26" data-end="41">es correcto</strong> — eso significa que:</p>
<p data-start="64" data-end="229">👉 <strong data-start="67" data-end="122">Tu archivo <code data-start="80" data-end="92">index.html</code> ya está publicado en Vercel</strong><br data-start="122" data-end="125">
👉 Pero <strong data-start="133" data-end="170">NO es aún tu dominio jvsys.com.mx</strong>, sino el dominio temporal de Vercel (<code data-start="208" data-end="228">landing.vercel.app</code>)</p>
<hr data-start="231" data-end="234">
<h2 data-section-id="699dz9" data-start="236" data-end="260">🔍 Diagnóstico exacto</h2>
<p data-start="262" data-end="274">Lo que pasó:</p>
<ol data-start="276" data-end="472">
<li data-section-id="3hn0np" data-start="276" data-end="310">
<p data-start="279" data-end="310">Subiste el archivo a GitHub ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="60g2h8" data-start="311" data-end="370">
<p data-start="314" data-end="370">Vercel detectó el repo y lo desplegó automáticamente ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19i1pgi" data-start="371" data-end="427">
<p data-start="374" data-end="427">Te dio un dominio temporal (<code data-start="402" data-end="422">landing.vercel.app</code>) ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r8eied" data-start="428" data-end="472">
<p data-start="431" data-end="472">Estás viendo ese deploy correctamente ✅</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="474" data-end="512">👉 Hasta aquí TODO bien. No hay error.</p>
<hr data-start="514" data-end="517">
<h2 data-section-id="1b1apc" data-start="519" data-end="545">🚨 Lo que falta (clave)</h2>
<p data-start="547" data-end="603">Aún <strong data-start="551" data-end="595">NO estás viendo jvsys.com.mx actualizado</strong> porque:</p>
<p data-start="605" data-end="735">👉 El dominio todavía no está apuntando correctamente al proyecto en Vercel<br data-start="680" data-end="683">
👉 O el cambio DNS aún no ha propagado completamente</p>
<hr data-start="737" data-end="740">
<h2 data-section-id="15yf89o" data-start="742" data-end="788">✅ Ahora vamos paso a paso (SIN asumir nada)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="sqovgw" data-start="790" data-end="826">PASO 1 — Confirma esto en Vercel</h3>
<p data-start="828" data-end="857">Entra a tu proyecto y revisa:</p>
<p data-start="859" data-end="884">👉 <strong data-start="862" data-end="884">Settings → Domains</strong></p>
<p data-start="886" data-end="905">Debes ver algo así:</p>
<ul data-start="907" data-end="944">
<li data-section-id="18hpo6x" data-start="907" data-end="923">
<p data-start="909" data-end="923"><code data-start="909" data-end="923">jvsys.com.mx</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14rpj40" data-start="924" data-end="944">
<p data-start="926" data-end="944"><code data-start="926" data-end="944">www.jvsys.com.mx</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="946" data-end="949">
<h3 data-section-id="1c10umd" data-start="951" data-end="976">PASO 2 — Dime qué ves</h3>
<p data-start="978" data-end="1049">Antes de avanzar, necesito que me confirmes UNA de estas 3 situaciones:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="nlwivj" data-start="1051" data-end="1063">OPCIÓN A</h3>
<p data-start="1064" data-end="1102">👉 Ves tu dominio en Vercel pero dice:</p>
<ul data-start="1103" data-end="1133">
<li data-section-id="1q3eqg" data-start="1103" data-end="1114">
<p data-start="1105" data-end="1114">“Invalid”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16qu1v4" data-start="1115" data-end="1133">
<p data-start="1117" data-end="1133">“Not configured”</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="nlwivg" data-start="1135" data-end="1147">OPCIÓN B</h3>
<p data-start="1148" data-end="1182">👉 NO aparece tu dominio en Vercel</p>
<h3 data-section-id="nlwivh" data-start="1184" data-end="1196">OPCIÓN C</h3>
<p data-start="1197" data-end="1248">👉 Sí aparece y dice “Valid” pero aún no se refleja</p>
<hr data-start="1250" data-end="1253">
<h2 data-section-id="ojn87x" data-start="1255" data-end="1293">⚠️ Importante (no avances sin esto)</h2>
<p data-start="1295" data-end="1349">No vamos a tocar nada más hasta confirmar eso, porque:</p>
<p data-start="1351" data-end="1434">👉 Aquí es donde el 90% de errores ocurre (DNS mal apuntado o dominio no vinculado)</p>
<hr data-start="1436" data-end="1439">
<h2 data-section-id="ucjyuw" data-start="1441" data-end="1477">💡 Mientras tanto, claridad total</h2>
<ul data-start="1479" data-end="1628">
<li data-section-id="bsot1p" data-start="1479" data-end="1550">
<p data-start="1481" data-end="1550">Lo que ves en <code data-start="1495" data-end="1515">landing.vercel.app</code> = <strong data-start="1518" data-end="1550">tu versión nueva funcionando</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1utti4g" data-start="1551" data-end="1628">
<p data-start="1553" data-end="1628">Lo que ves en <code data-start="1567" data-end="1581">jvsys.com.mx</code> = <strong data-start="1584" data-end="1628">aún puede ser la versión vieja o parking</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1630" data-end="1633">
<h2 data-section-id="rffjb4" data-start="1635" data-end="1655">🎯 Siguiente paso</h2>
<p data-start="1657" data-end="1687">Respóndeme con captura o dime:</p>
<p data-start="1689" data-end="1748">👉 ¿Qué ves exactamente en <strong data-start="1716" data-end="1747">Vercel → Settings → Domains</strong>?</p>
<p data-start="1750" data-end="1839" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Y con eso te llevo al siguiente paso exacto, sin perder tiempo ni hacer pruebas a ciegas.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Acciones de respuesta" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar respuesta" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Respuesta adecuada" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondar