con claridad quirúrgica:</p>
<hr data-start="62" data-end="65">
<h2 data-section-id="h4c6wr" data-start="67" data-end="89">🔍 DIAGNÓSTICO REAL</h2>
<p data-start="91" data-end="113">En tu captura aparece:</p>
<p data-start="115" data-end="212">👉 <strong data-start="118" data-end="169"><code data-start="120" data-end="138">www.jvsys.com...</code> (incompleto / no confirmado)</strong><br data-start="169" data-end="172">
👉 <strong data-start="175" data-end="210"><code data-start="177" data-end="203">jvsys-landing.vercel.app</code> (OK)</strong></p>
<p data-start="214" data-end="272">Y <strong data-start="216" data-end="272">NO veo <code data-start="225" data-end="239">jvsys.com.mx</code> raíz configurado correctamente</strong></p>
<hr data-start="274" data-end="277">
<h2 data-section-id="mbt9fo" data-start="279" data-end="300">⚠️ PROBLEMA EXACTO</h2>
<p data-start="302" data-end="348">Tienes SOLO parcialmente conectado el dominio:</p>
<ul data-start="350" data-end="451">
<li data-section-id="152j13c" data-start="350" data-end="404">
<p data-start="352" data-end="404">✅ Subdominio (probablemente <code data-start="380" data-end="385">www</code>) → medio conectado</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1isbw0v" data-start="405" data-end="451">
<p data-start="407" data-end="451">❌ Dominio raíz <code data-start="422" data-end="436">jvsys.com.mx</code> → NO conectado</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="453" data-end="500">👉 Por eso no ves tu landing en tu dominio real</p>
<hr data-start="502" data-end="505">
<h2 data-section-id="nn73ll" data-start="507" data-end="560">🎯 VAMOS A SOLUCIONARLO (PASO A PASO, SIN ERRORES)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="121o8h0" data-start="562" data-end="612">🔹 PASO 1 — Agregar dominio raíz correctamente</h3>
<p data-start="614" data-end="636">En esa misma pantalla:</p>
<p data-start="638" data-end="668">👉 Da click en <strong data-start="653" data-end="668">“Domains +”</strong></p>
<p data-start="670" data-end="692">Y escribe EXACTAMENTE:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="694" data-end="714"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>jvsys.com.mx</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="716" data-end="731">👉 Dale <strong data-start="724" data-end="731">Add</strong></p>
<hr data-start="733" data-end="736">
<h2 data-section-id="1udlt9x" data-start="738" data-end="777">🔹 PASO 2 — Vercel te va a pedir DNS</h2>
<p data-start="779" data-end="833">Aquí es donde se define todo. Te va a pedir algo como:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1mu3t8z" data-start="835" data-end="861">OPCIÓN A (recomendada)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="862" data-end="904"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Type: A</span><br><span>Name: @</span><br><span>Value: 76.76.21.21</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="a1ey6y" data-start="906" data-end="924">OPCIÓN B (www)</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="925" data-end="982"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Type: CNAME</span><br><span>Name: www</span><br><span>Value: cname.vercel-dns.com</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="984" data-end="987">
<h2 data-section-id="4sruqc" data-start="989" data-end="1032">🔹 PASO 3 — Ir a tu proveedor de dominio</h2>
<p data-start="1034" data-end="1086">Donde compraste el dominio (Hostinger probablemente)</p>
<p data-start="1088" data-end="1097">👉 Busca:</p>
<ul data-start="1098" data-end="1126">
<li data-section-id="1o4e9d" data-start="1098" data-end="1103">
<p data-start="1100" data-end="1103">DNS</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12kz31n" data-start="1104" data-end="1114">
<p data-start="1106" data-end="1114">Zona DNS</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tn5mmw" data-start="1115" data-end="1126">
<p data-start="1117" data-end="1126">Registros</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1128" data-end="1153">Y agrega EXACTAMENTE eso.</p>
<hr data-start="1155" data-end="1158">
<h2 data-section-id="1aw2ih2" data-start="1160" data-end="1206">⚠️ ERRORES COMUNES QUE ESTÁS CERCA DE TENER</h2>
<ul data-start="1208" data-end="1309">
<li data-section-id="zj75td" data-start="1208" data-end="1243">
<p data-start="1210" data-end="1243">Tener solo <code data-start="1221" data-end="1226">www</code> y no el raíz ❌</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d5a25e" data-start="1244" data-end="1276">
<p data-start="1246" data-end="1276">Tener registros duplicados ❌</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rgtndz" data-start="1277" data-end="1309">
<p data-start="1279" data-end="1309">No borrar registros viejos ❌</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1311" data-end="1314">
<h2 data-section-id="1ggipz2" data-start="1316" data-end="1362">🔹 PASO 4 — Esperar (pero inteligentemente)</h2>
<p data-start="1364" data-end="1399">No es solo esperar 30 min a ciegas.</p>
<p data-start="1401" data-end="1426">👉 Después de configurar:</p>
<ol data-start="1428" data-end="1486">
<li data-section-id="1ivich1" data-start="1428" data-end="1449">
<p data-start="1431" data-end="1449">Regresa a Vercel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8vagal" data-start="1450" data-end="1486">
<p data-start="1453" data-end="1468">Debe cambiar a:</p>
<ul data-start="1472" data-end="1486">
<li data-section-id="in1me9" data-start="1472" data-end="1486">
<p data-start="1474" data-end="1486">🟢 <strong data-start="1477" data-end="1486">Valid</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1488" data-end="1491">
<h2 data-section-id="13s5yrs" data-start="1493" data-end="1517">💡 ESTADO ACTUAL TUYO</h2>
<p data-start="1519" data-end="1581">✔ Deploy correcto<br data-start="1536" data-end="1539">
✔ Código correcto<br data-start="1556" data-end="1559">
✔ Vercel funcionando</p>
<p data-start="1583" data-end="1605">❌ Dominio incompleto</p>
<hr data-start="1607" data-end="1610">
<h2 data-section-id="1p47vik" data-start="1612" data-end="1645">🚀 SIGUIENTE PASO (IMPORTANTE)</h2>
<p data-start="1647" data-end="1662">Haz esto AHORA:</p>
<ol data-start="1664" data-end="1703">
<li data-section-id="t6dptu" data-start="1664" data-end="1692">
<p data-start="1667" data-end="1692">Da click en <strong data-start="1679" data-end="1692">Domains +</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17z9qvo" data-start="1693" data-end="1703">
<p data-start="1696" data-end="1703">Agrega:</p>
