<h2 data-section-id="uwjp21" data-start="11" data-end="52">🔹 PASO 1 (solo uno, sin adelantarnos)</h2>
<p data-start="54" data-end="83">👉 Da click en <strong data-start="69" data-end="79">“Edit”</strong> en:</p>
<p data-start="85" data-end="125"><strong data-start="85" data-end="103"><code data-start="87" data-end="101">jvsys.com.mx</code></strong> (el que NO tiene www)</p>
<hr data-start="127" data-end="130">
<p data-start="132" data-end="174">Cuando entres ahí, Vercel te va a mostrar:</p>
<ul data-start="176" data-end="238">
<li data-section-id="gkm9oj" data-start="176" data-end="206">
<p data-start="178" data-end="206">Tipo de registro (A o CNAME)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vod2fr" data-start="207" data-end="222">
<p data-start="209" data-end="222">Nombre (Name)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m3e3fo" data-start="223" data-end="238">
<p data-start="225" data-end="238">Valor (Value)</p>
</li>
