<h2 data-section-id="ddqkjd" data-start="39" data-end="51">🔹 PASO 5</h2>
<p data-start="53" data-end="68">👉 Da click en:</p>
<p data-start="70" data-end="89"><strong data-start="70" data-end="89">“Registros DNS”</strong></p>
