<h2 data-section-id="19ll1hx" data-start="45" data-end="73">🔴 DIAGNÓSTICO DEFINITIVO</h2>
<p data-start="75" data-end="102">👉 Vercel te está diciendo:</p>
<p data-start="104" data-end="142"><strong data-start="104" data-end="142">“Update your domain's nameservers”</strong></p>
<p data-start="144" data-end="153">👉 O sea:</p>
<p data-start="155" data-end="219">🔴 Tus nameservers <strong data-start="174" data-end="219">NO están correctamente apuntando a Vercel</strong></p>
<hr data-start="221" data-end="224">
<h2 data-section-id="1ex0yv" data-start="226" data-end="255">🔹 PASO 11 (EL IMPORTANTE)</h2>
<p data-start="257" data-end="301">👉 Regresa a Hostinger (donde estabas antes)</p>
<p data-start="303" data-end="320">Donde viste esto:</p>
<ul data-start="322" data-end="371">
<li data-section-id="ki5e7u" data-start="322" data-end="346">
