<p data-start="46" data-end="152">✔️ El despliegue está <strong data-start="68" data-end="77">LISTO</strong><br data-start="77" data-end="80">
✔️ Está usando <strong data-start="95" data-end="116">index.html v2.1.0</strong><br data-start="116" data-end="119">
✔️ El dominio ya está conectado</p>
<hr data-start="154" data-end="157">
<h2 data-section-id="as1s65" data-start="159" data-end="210">🔴 Entonces… ¿por qué no ves el diseño correcto?</h2>
<p data-start="212" data-end="289">Porque <strong data-start="219" data-end="275">tu navegador está mostrando versión en caché (vieja)</strong>, no la nueva.</p>
<hr data-start="291" data-end="294">
<h2 data-section-id="1x8lduv" data-start="296" data-end="339">✅ SIGUE ESTO EXACTO (sin saltarte pasos)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1ns77tq" data-start="341" data-end="362">1. Abre tu sitio:</h3>
<p data-start="363" data-end="386">👉 <a data-start="366" data-end="386" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://jvsys.com.mx/">https://jvsys.com.mx<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<hr data-start="388" data-end="391">
<h3 data-section-id="xi8olm" data-start="393" data-end="429">2. Fuerza recarga dura (CRÍTICO)</h3>
<p data-start="431" data-end="449">En tu computadora:</p>
<p data-start="451" data-end="478"><strong data-start="451" data-end="478">Opción A (recomendada):</strong></p>
<ul data-start="479" data-end="507">
<li data-section-id="1b9rae8" data-start="479" data-end="507">
<p data-start="481" data-end="507">Presiona:<br data-start="490" data-end="493">
👉 <code data-start="496" data-end="507">Ctrl + F5</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="509" data-end="522"><strong data-start="509" data-end="522">Opción B:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="523" data-end="610">
<li data-section-id="cdtwix" data-start="523" data-end="566">
<p data-start="525" data-end="566">Mantén presionado el botón de recargar 🔄</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1igu9lt" data-start="567" data-end="610">
<p data-start="569" data-end="610">Selecciona: <strong data-start="581" data-end="610">“Vaciar caché y recargar”</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="612" data-end="615">
<h3 data-section-id="1k129fk" data-start="617" data-end="639">3. Si sigue igual:</h3>
<p data-start="640" data-end="649">Haz esto:</p>
<ul data-start="651" data-end="726">
<li data-section-id="1bu0yaz" data-start="651" data-end="691">
<p data-start="653" data-end="691">Abre una pestaña en <strong data-start="673" data-end="691">modo incógnito</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ovwiox" data-start="692" data-end="726">
<p data-start="694" data-end="726">Entra a:<br>
👉 <a data-start="706" data-end="726" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://jvsys.com.mx/">https://jvsys.com.mx<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="728" data-end="731">
<h2 data-section-id="mp0bsd" data-start="733" data-end="765">🔍 Qué debes ver (validación)</h2>
<p data-start="767" data-end="781">Debe aparecer:</p>
<p data-start="783" data-end="1003">✔ Fondo azul tecnológico<br data-start="807" data-end="810">
✔ Imagen de laptop con nube<br data-start="837" data-end="840">
✔ Menú superior completo (Inicio, Soluciones, Proyectos, etc.)<br data-start="902" data-end="905">
✔ Sección “Nuestras Aplicaciones”<br data-start="938" data-end="941">
✔ Tarjetas de apps<br data-start="959" data-end="962">
✔ Estilo profesional (NO bloques simples)</p>
<hr data-start="1005" data-end="1008">
<h2 data-section-id="o9ju94" data-start="1010" data-end="1043">⚠️ Si después de eso sigue mal</h2>
<p data-start="1045" data-end="1086">Entonces el problema NO es DNS ni Vercel.</p>
<p data-start="1088" data-end="1106">Será uno de estos:</p>
<ol data-start="1107" data-end="1289">
<li data-section-id="msmjvj" data-start="1107" data-end="1172">
<p data-start="1110" data-end="1172">El archivo no se reemplazó correctamente (mezcla de versiones)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r0pxt3" data-start="1173" data-end="1225">
<p data-start="1176" data-end="1225">El HTML nuevo no incluye bien las imágenes/assets</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uxp6jb" data-start="1226" data-end="1289">
<p data-start="1229" data-end="1289">Hay rutas rotas (imagenes no cargan → diseño se ve “trunco”)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1291" data-end="1294">
<h2 data-section-id="1p47vik" data-start="1296" data-end="1329">🚀 SIGUIENTE PASO (IMPORTANTE)</h2>
<p data-start="1331" data-end="1376">Después de que recargues, mándame captura de:</p>
<p data-start="1378" data-end="1426">👉 cómo se ve <strong data-start="1392" data-end="1426">jvsys.com.mx en modo incógnito</strong></p>
<p data-start="1428" data-end="1465">Ahí voy a diagnosticar con precisión:</p>
<ul data-start="1467" data-end="1539">
<li data-section-id="10bf7if" data-start="1467" data-end="1478">
<p data-start="1469" data-end="1478">si es CSS</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="x3u9vx" data-start="1479" data-end="1502">
<p data-start="1481" data-end="1502">si es rutas de imagen</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ppiwpf" data-start="1503" data-end="1539">
<p data-start="1505" data-end="1539">o si el HTML aún no es el correcto</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1541" data-end="1544">
<p data-start="1546" data-end="1580">Y sí, te explicaste perfectamente:</p>
<p data-start="1582" data-end="1761">👉 El botón <strong data-start="1594" data-end="1609">Condo Admin</strong> debe abrir un <strong data-start="1624" data-end="1667">módulo independiente (sección o página)</strong><br data-start="1667" data-end="1670">
Eso lo vamos a dejar <strong data-start="1691" data-end="1734">bien estructurado tipo SaaS profesional</strong>, no un scroll improvisado.</p>
<p data-start="1763" data-end="1850" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Primero confirmamos que ya estás viendo la versión correcta. Luego afinamos ese módulo.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Acciones de respuesta" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copiar respuesta" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Respuesta adecuada" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary 