ipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">pathlib</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">Path</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">r'''&lt;!--</span><br><span class="ͼc">ARCHIVO: index.html</span><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN: v2.2.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">FECHA: 2026-04-26</span><br><span class="ͼc">PROYECTO: Landing institucional JVSys + módulo comercial Condo Admin</span><br><span class="ͼc">DESCRIPCIÓN:</span><br><span class="ͼc">Landing profesional para JVSys orientada a promoción de soluciones SaaS Audit-Proof.</span><br><span class="ͼc">Incluye un módulo interno independiente para Condo Admin, pensado como pieza comercial</span><br><span class="ͼc">para captar la atención de administradores, mesas directivas, desarrolladores inmobiliarios</span><br><span class="ͼc">y responsables de fraccionamientos/condominios.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">OBJETIVO COMERCIAL:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Presentar JVSys como fabricante de plataformas SaaS serias, seguras y trazables.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Evitar imágenes abstractas o truncadas que no comuniquen valor.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Dirigir el botón Condo Admin hacia un módulo comercial independiente dentro de la landing.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Convertir el módulo Condo Admin en una propuesta clara: problema, solución, beneficios,</span><br><span class="ͼc">  evidencia operativa, llamada a la acción y confianza.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Usar como base visual el cartel promocional de Condo Admin proporcionado por el usuario.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">CAMBIO PRINCIPAL v2.2.0:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se elimina el visual abstracto/trunco de laptop/nube que no comunicaba profesionalismo.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se rediseña el hero de JVSys con arquitectura visual limpia, seria y orientada a confianza.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- El menú y la tarjeta de Condo Admin apuntan al módulo interno #condo-admin.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se agrega módulo comercial Condo Admin tipo landing interna.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se usa la imagen promocional condo-admin-promo.png sin recortarla.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se integran rutas para logos reales del repositorio:</span><br><span class="ͼc">  Logo_JVsys.png</span><br><span class="ͼc">  Logo_Fracc.jpeg</span><br><span class="ͼc">  condo-admin-promo.png</span><br><span class="ͼc">- El diseño conserva estética azul profesional y enfoque SaaS Audit-Proof.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN ANTERIOR:</span><br><span class="ͼc">index.html v2.1.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">TOTAL DE LÍNEAS VERSIÓN ANTERIOR: 639</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN NUEVA:</span><br><span class="ͼc">index.html v2.2.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">TOTAL DE LÍNEAS VERSIÓN NUEVA: __TOTAL_LINEAS__</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">INSTRUCCIÓN DE INSTALACIÓN:</span><br><span class="ͼc">Este archivo debe reemplazar COMPLETAMENTE al index.html actual del repositorio.</span><br><span class="ͼc">No aplicar parches parciales.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">ARCHIVOS DE IMAGEN QUE DEBEN EXISTIR EN EL REPOSITORIO:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Logo_JVsys.png</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Logo_Fracc.jpeg</span><br><span class="ͼc">- condo-admin-promo.png</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">FIN DE DOCUMENTACIÓN INTERNA</span><br><span class="ͼc">--&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;html lang="es"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;head&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;title&gt;JVSys | Desarrollo de Apps SaaS Audit-Proof&lt;/title&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta name="description" content="JVSys desarrolla plataformas SaaS Audit-Proof para administración, cobranza, documentos, reportes y operación confiable. Condo Admin ayuda a administrar fraccionamientos con transparencia financiera y evidencia real." /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;style&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    :root {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-0: #020814;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-1: #06162b;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-2: #092a50;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --card: rgba(9, 28, 54, 0.86);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --card-2: rgba(12, 43, 78, 0.72);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --line: rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.22);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --line-strong: rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.42);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --blue: #0978ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --blue-2: #39c5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --cyan: #8bdcff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --white: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --muted: #c6d8ec;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --soft: #8fa9c3;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --green: #2fb36d;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --gold: #ffd36a;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --radius-xl: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --radius-lg: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --max: 1180px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    * {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-sizing: border-box;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    html {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      scroll-behavior: smooth;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    body {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 100vh;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--white);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.16), transparent 28%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 8%, rgba(9, 120, 255, 0.20), transparent 30%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-0), var(--bg-1) 42%, #020814);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.45;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    a {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: inherit;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-decoration: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .shell {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 40px));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0 auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .topbar {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: sticky;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      top: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      z-index: 50;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(2, 8, 20, 0.92);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.16);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .nav {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 82px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-width: 260px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-logo {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 62px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 62px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.45));</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-name {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -0.7px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-sub {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 2px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 700;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #eaf5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu a {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      opacity: 0.9;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu a:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      opacity: 1;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: inline-flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 9px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 50px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid transparent;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      cursor: pointer;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      white-space: nowrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transform: translateY(-2px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn-primary {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0787ff, #005be3);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #fff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(9, 120, 255, 0.34);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn-ghost {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.32);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #e8f5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 76px 0 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .eyebrow {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-transform: uppercase;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: 2.6px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero h1 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(46px, 6vw, 80px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 0.98;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -2.5px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 720px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .accent {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--blue-2);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 29px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.35;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 650px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding-top: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-icon {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.10);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 4px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.4;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-panel {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(11, 55, 101, 0.58), rgba(4, 19, 39, 0.88)),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.24), transparent 34%);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 470px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: var(--shadow);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: relative;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-panel::before {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      content: "";</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: absolute;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      inset: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.20);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 48%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.16) 49% 51%, transparent 52% 100%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 48%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.10) 49% 51%, transparent 52% 100%);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: absolute;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 190px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 112px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(2, 14, 30, 0.80);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 17px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 13px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card.one {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      top: 58px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      left: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card.two {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      top: 130px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      right: 45px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card.three {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      bottom: 58px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      left: 74px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-card.four {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      bottom: 62px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      right: 70px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-core {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: absolute;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      inset: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      pointer-events: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-badge {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 150px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 150px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.40), rgba(9, 120, 255, 0.08) 68%, transparent);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.34);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #fff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.7);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 54px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -1px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .confidence {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: stretch;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(5, 21, 44, 0.76);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: var(--shadow);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .shield-box {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.22), rgba(4, 19, 39, 0.92));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 260px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .shield {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 132px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 152px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 34px 34px 52px 52px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 3px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.75);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 54px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .confidence-text {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 12px 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .confidence-text h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.14;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .confidence-text p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 700px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .check-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 12px 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .check {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #eaf5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .check::before {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      content: "✓";</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex: 0 0 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #04111f;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .apps {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 39, 74, 0.78), rgba(4, 17, 36, 0.86));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 20px 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 315px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transform: translateY(-5px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.62);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-icon {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 92px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 92px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #f4fbff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #0a3e78;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 44px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0 auto 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-icon img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: cover;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 19px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .mini-btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: inline-flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.35);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 800;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 13px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-module {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 76px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(234, 246, 255, 0.02), rgba(234, 246, 255, 0.05)),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 30%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.12), transparent 28%);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #edf7ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123762;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 34px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 640px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 56px 52px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(237, 247, 255, 0.96), rgba(225, 239, 250, 0.96));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand-row {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 54px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 54px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: right;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #526f8d;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 70px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.02;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -2px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #143f78;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy .condo-lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 28px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #2f4d70;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.32;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 680px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-actions .btn-ghost {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.22);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-list {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item .mark {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: var(--green);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(47, 179, 109, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #133c72;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #4c6583;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 3px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(237, 247, 255, 0.4), rgba(203, 226, 244, 0.75));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: relative;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .poster-frame {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 540px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.24);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .poster-frame img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-proof {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px 52px 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #dceefa;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-proof h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.08;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card h4 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #113d73;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 21px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #456281;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123c74, #0767d9);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 6px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #e4f4ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 17px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-self: end;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 58px 0 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr 0.8fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(5, 21, 44, 0.76);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip p,</span><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip li {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip ul {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      list-style: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .footer {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 42px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--soft);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 60px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .footer-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    @media (max-width: 1100px) {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .apps {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-grid,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-hero,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .confidence,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .contact-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-panel {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-height: 420px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-product {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        text-align: left;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-brand-row {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        margin-bottom: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .cta-band {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .cta-band .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        justify-self: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    @media (max-width: 760px) {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .shell {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: min(100% - 26px, var(--max));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .nav {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 14px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-width: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-logo {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        height: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-name {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 23px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-sub {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .menu {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        display: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .nav .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        display: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 42px 0 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero h1 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-actions,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .trust-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-panel {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-height: 450px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: 160px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-card.one {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        top: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        left: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-card.two {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        top: 105px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        right: 25px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-card.three {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        bottom: 42px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        left: 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-card.four {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        bottom: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        right: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .apps {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .check-grid,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .profile-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-proof {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 34px 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 43px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy .condo-lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 19px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .footer-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/style&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;body&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;header class="topbar"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;div class="shell nav"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Ir al inicio"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;img class="brand-logo" src="Logo_JVsys.png" alt="Logo JVSys" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="brand-name"&gt;JVSys&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="brand-sub"&gt;Desarrollo de Apps&lt;br /&gt;Audit-Proof en plataforma SaaS&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/a&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;nav class="menu" aria-label="Menú principal"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#inicio"&gt;Inicio&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#soluciones"&gt;Soluciones&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#proyectos"&gt;Proyectos&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#tecnologia"&gt;Tecnología&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#condo-admin"&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#contacto"&gt;Contacto&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/nav&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicitud%20de%20informes%20JVSys"&gt;✉ Solicitar informes&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/header&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;main id="inicio"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="hero"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="hero-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;SaaS · Evidencia · Control · Confianza&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h1&gt;Desarrollamos Apps SaaS &lt;span class="accent"&gt;Audit-Proof&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;p class="lead"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              Aplicaciones profesionales, seguras y trazables para administrar, operar y hacer crecer tu organización</span><br><span class="ͼc">              con información clara, evidencia confiable y procesos listos para auditoría.</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="hero-actions"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicitud%20de%20informes%20JVSys"&gt;✉ Solicitar informes&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#proyectos"&gt;▷ Conocer proyectos&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#condo-admin"&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="hero-panel" aria-label="Representación de plataforma audit-proof"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-card one"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;strong&gt;Cobranza&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;span&gt;Pagos, saldos y estados de cuenta con trazabilidad.&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-card two"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;strong&gt;Documentos&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;span&gt;Comprobantes, solicitudes y evidencia recuperable.&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-card three"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;strong&gt;Roles&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;span&gt;Accesos por perfil y operación controlada.&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-card four"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;strong&gt;Reportes&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;span&gt;Información clara para decidir y rendir cuentas.&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-core"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="proof-badge"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="trust-strip" id="soluciones"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;◇&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit-Proof&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cada acción importante es rastreable, verificable y comprobable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;🔒&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seguridad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Protección de datos, roles y control de acceso.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;☁&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plataforma SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Arquitectura moderna, escalable y lista para crecer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;↗&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eficiencia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Automatización de procesos y reportes útiles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confianza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sistemas estables, claros y hechos para durar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="section" id="tecnologia"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="confidence"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="shield-box"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="shield"&gt;⌘&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="confidence-text"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h2&gt;No solo desarrollamos software. &lt;span class="accent"&gt;Construimos confianza y evidencia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                En JVSys aplicamos un enfoque Audit-Proof: cada sistema debe explicar quién hizo qué,</span><br><span class="ͼc">                cuándo, desde dónde y con qué evidencia operativa.</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="check-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Trazabilidad completa de operaciones&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Control documental y generación de PDF&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Roles, permisos y niveles de autorización&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Tecnología moderna y buenas prácticas&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Preparados para auditorías e inspecciones&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="check"&gt;Diseño SaaS multi-organización&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="section" id="proyectos"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="section-title"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;h2&gt;Nuestras Aplicaciones y Proyectos&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;p&gt;Soluciones pensadas para necesidades reales.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="apps"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;&lt;img src="Logo_Fracc.jpeg" alt="Logo Condo Admin" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Plataforma SaaS para administración de fraccionamientos y condominios. Cobranza, estados de cuenta, control documental y trazabilidad audit-proof.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#condo-admin"&gt;Abrir módulo&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;P&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;PENZIO&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Aplicación para planificación pensionaria Ley 1973. Cálculos, escenarios, reportes y acompañamiento digital.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;👨‍👩‍👧&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Pulungos CAI&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Sistema para control de acceso, asistencia, comunicación y administración operativa de estancia infantil.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;₿&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;BitMercado MX&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;MVP para operaciones P2P de Bitcoin en México con enfoque en reputación, seguridad y flujo controlado.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;911&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Mi911&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Plataforma de asistencia, alertas y registro de incidentes para una respuesta coordinada y efectiva.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;📄&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Plataformas Documentales&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Emisión, recuperación, validación y trazabilidad de documentos PDF institucionales con firma y evidencia.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="condo-module" id="condo-admin"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="condo-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="condo-hero"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="condo-copy"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-brand-row"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-brand"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;img src="Logo_JVsys.png" alt="Logo JVSys" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;span&gt;JVSys&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-product"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;strong&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;span&gt;Administración Inteligente de Condominios&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h2&gt;La nueva forma de administrar tu fraccionamiento&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p class="condo-lead"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                Control total, transparencia financiera y decisiones inteligentes con evidencia real.</span><br><span class="ͼc">                Menos discusiones, menos hojas sueltas y más claridad para todos.</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-actions"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicito%20presentaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Condo%20Admin"&gt;Solicitar presentación&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#beneficios-condo"&gt;Ver beneficios&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-list" id="beneficios-condo"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard financiero inteligente&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Indicadores claros para entender cobranza, morosidad, ingresos y decisiones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cobranza con sello digital&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Comprobantes con evidencia, control administrativo y recuperación documental.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QR de autenticidad en comprobantes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pagos verificables y comprobantes consultables cuando el administrador lo requiera.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitácora completa del sistema&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cada acción importante queda registrada para fortalecer confianza y transparencia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reportes y estados de cuenta automáticos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Historial completo por casa, adeudos vencidos, pagos y documentos relacionados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="condo-visual"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="poster-frame"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;img src="condo-admin-promo.png" alt="Promocional Condo Admin para administración inteligente de condominios" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="condo-proof"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h3&gt;Diseñado para quien necesita ordenar, cobrar, comprobar y rendir cuentas.&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="profile-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Administradores&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Centraliza cobranza, reportes, documentos, comprobantes y seguimiento de solicitudes sin depender de archivos dispersos.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Mesas directivas&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Obtén claridad financiera, evidencia de pagos y reportes confiables para reducir dudas y transparentar decisiones.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Desarrolladores y fraccionamientos&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Profesionaliza la operación desde el inicio con una plataforma SaaS preparada para crecer por comunidad.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="cta-band"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h3&gt;Transparencia y control real para tu fraccionamiento&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Sistema operando con enfoque audit-proof, pensado para administración seria y resultados verificables.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Quiero%20conocer%20Condo%20Admin"&gt;Quiero conocer Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="contact-strip" id="contacto"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h2&gt;¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;p&gt;Hablemos y encontremos la mejor solución para tu operación.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;ul&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;li&gt;✉ xve.montes@gmail.com&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;li&gt;✉ xvm.designs@gmail.com&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;li&gt;📍 Ciudad de México, MX&lt;/li&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/ul&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicitud%20de%20informes%20JVSys"&gt;Solicitar informes&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/main&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;footer class="footer"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;div class="shell footer-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div&gt;© 2026 JVSys. Todos los derechos reservados.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div&gt;Desarrollo de Apps SaaS · Audit-Proof · Tecnología seria para procesos que no pueden fallar.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/footer&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;/body&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;/html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;!-- FIN DE ARCHIVO: index.html v2.2.0 --&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">'''</span><br><br><span class="ͼ6"># line count replacement</span><br><span class="ͼe">lines</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">html</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>splitlines()</span><br><span class="ͼe">count</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">len</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">lines</span><span>)</span><br><span class="ͼe">html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">html</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>replace(</span><span class="ͼc">"__TOTAL_LINEAS__"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">str</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">count</span><span>))</span><br><span class="ͼ6"># recalc if digits don't alter line count, no issue</span><br><span class="ͼe">path</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">Path</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼc">"/mnt/data/index_html_v2_2_0_jvsys_condoadmin_profesional.txt"</span><span>)</span><br><span class="ͼe">path</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>write_text(</span><span class="ͼe">html</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">encoding</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"utf-8"</span><span>)</span><br><span class="ͼe">print</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼc">f"Archivo generado: </span><span>{</span><span class="ͼe">path</span><span>}</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span>)</span><br><span class="ͼe">print</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼc">f"Líneas: </span><span>{</span><span class="ͼe">len</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">html</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>splitlines())}</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span>)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-tertiary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default) hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary">Pensó durante 16s<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="icon-xs"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#b140e7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="a08cecbc-0f4a-437a-a0d4-a42448c0611a" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-5-thinking" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="32">Sí, te explicaste perfectamente.</p>
<p data-start="34" data-end="60">El problema real es doble:</p>
<ol data-start="62" data-end="299">
<li data-section-id="w6l7mu" data-start="62" data-end="127">
<p data-start="65" data-end="127">El hero actual todavía parece “decorativo”, no comunica valor.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zdkz26" data-start="128" data-end="299">
<p data-start="131" data-end="299">El botón <strong data-start="140" data-end="155">Condo Admin</strong> no debe ser solo un scroll cualquiera; debe llevar a un <strong data-start="212" data-end="240">módulo comercial interno</strong> serio, con propuesta de venta, usando tu cartel como base.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="301" data-end="339">Ya preparé una versión completa nueva:</p>
<p data-start="341" data-end="463"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">index_html_v2_2_0_jvsys_condoadmin_profesional.txt</button></span></p>
<p data-start="465" data-end="478">Esta versión:</p>
<ul data-start="479" data-end="713">
<li data-section-id="1lqlzg8" data-start="479" data-end="516">
<p data-start="481" data-end="516">Elimina la imagen abstracta/trunca.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="150d0np" data-start="517" data-end="536">
<p data-start="519" data-end="536">Usa logos reales.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1c1m16b" data-start="537" data-end="594">
<p data-start="539" data-end="594">Hace que <strong data-start="548" data-end="563">Condo Admin</strong> abra el módulo <code data-start="579" data-end="593">#condo-admin</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hzg14f" data-start="595" data-end="645">
<p data-start="597" data-end="645">Usa el cartel como imagen completa, sin recorte.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18a1hzv" data-start="646" data-end="713">
<p data-start="648" data-end="713">Convierte Condo Admin en módulo comercial más claro y persuasivo.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="715" data-end="847" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">También debes subir al repo estos archivos con estos nombres exactos:<br>
