ss="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>Python</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">pathlib</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">Path</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">r'''&lt;!--</span><br><span class="ͼc">ARCHIVO: index.html</span><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN: v2.3.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">FECHA: 2026-04-26</span><br><span class="ͼc">PROYECTO: Landing institucional JVSys + Condo Admin</span><br><span class="ͼc">DESCRIPCIÓN:</span><br><span class="ͼc">Landing profesional para JVSys y módulo comercial Condo Admin con enfoque SaaS Audit-Proof.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">OBJETIVO COMERCIAL:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Sustituir imágenes genéricas o poco persuasivas por una imagen tipo mockup SaaS profesional.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Comunicar valor comercial inmediato: control, evidencia, cobranza, documentos y confianza.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Conectar el mensaje visual con el dolor real de administradores y mesas directivas.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Mantener el botón Condo Admin como entrada directa al módulo comercial interno.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">CAMBIO PRINCIPAL v2.3.0:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se rediseña la sección de confianza/evidencia.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se reemplaza el bloque abstracto por un bloque comercial:</span><br><span class="ͼc">  "Control real, no suposiciones."</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se prepara integración de imagen mockup-condo-admin-saas.png.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se conserva la estructura general v2.2.0.</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Se mantiene documentación interna encapsulada como comentario HTML.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN ANTERIOR:</span><br><span class="ͼc">index.html v2.2.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">TOTAL DE LÍNEAS VERSIÓN ANTERIOR: 872</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">VERSIÓN NUEVA:</span><br><span class="ͼc">index.html v2.3.0</span><br><span class="ͼc">TOTAL DE LÍNEAS VERSIÓN NUEVA: __TOTAL_LINEAS__</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">ARCHIVOS DE IMAGEN QUE DEBEN EXISTIR EN EL REPOSITORIO:</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Logo_JVsys.png</span><br><span class="ͼc">- Logo_Fracc.jpeg</span><br><span class="ͼc">- condo-admin-promo.png</span><br><span class="ͼc">- mockup-condo-admin-saas.png</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">INSTRUCCIÓN DE INSTALACIÓN:</span><br><span class="ͼc">Este archivo debe reemplazar COMPLETAMENTE al index.html actual del repositorio.</span><br><span class="ͼc">No aplicar parches parciales.</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">FIN DE DOCUMENTACIÓN INTERNA</span><br><span class="ͼc">--&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;html lang="es"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;head&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta charset="UTF-8" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;title&gt;JVSys | Desarrollo de Apps SaaS Audit-Proof&lt;/title&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;meta name="description" content="JVSys desarrolla plataformas SaaS Audit-Proof para administración, cobranza, documentos, reportes y operación confiable. Condo Admin ayuda a administrar fraccionamientos con transparencia financiera y evidencia real." /&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;style&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    :root {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-0: #020814;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-1: #06162b;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --bg-2: #092a50;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --card: rgba(9, 28, 54, 0.86);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --card-2: rgba(12, 43, 78, 0.72);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --line: rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.22);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --line-strong: rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.42);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --blue: #0978ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --blue-2: #39c5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --cyan: #8bdcff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --white: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --muted: #c6d8ec;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --soft: #8fa9c3;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --green: #2fb36d;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --gold: #ffd36a;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --radius-xl: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --radius-lg: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      --max: 1180px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    * {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-sizing: border-box;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    html {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      scroll-behavior: smooth;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    body {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 100vh;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--white);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.16), transparent 28%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 8%, rgba(9, 120, 255, 0.20), transparent 30%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-0), var(--bg-1) 42%, #020814);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.45;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    a {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: inherit;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-decoration: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .shell {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: min(var(--max), calc(100% - 40px));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0 auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .topbar {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: sticky;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      top: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      z-index: 50;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(2, 8, 20, 0.92);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(135, 199, 255, 0.16);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .nav {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 82px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-width: 260px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-logo {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 62px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 62px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 18px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.45));</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-name {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -0.7px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .brand-sub {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 2px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 700;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #eaf5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu a {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      opacity: 0.9;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .menu a:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      opacity: 1;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: inline-flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 9px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 50px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid transparent;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      cursor: pointer;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      white-space: nowrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transform: translateY(-2px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn-primary {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0787ff, #005be3);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #fff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(9, 120, 255, 0.34);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .btn-ghost {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.32);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #e8f5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 76px 0 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .eyebrow {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-transform: uppercase;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: 2.6px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero h1 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(46px, 6vw, 80px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 0.98;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -2.5px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 720px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .accent {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--blue-2);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 29px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.35;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 650px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(11, 55, 101, 0.58), rgba(4, 19, 39, 0.88));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: var(--shadow);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 470px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .hero-visual img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding-top: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-icon {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.10);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 4px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .trust-item span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.4;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 54px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -1px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .section-title p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-section {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.16), transparent 36%),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(5, 21, 44, 0.86), rgba(8, 34, 66, 0.72));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: var(--shadow);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-copy h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 54px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.05;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -1.4px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-copy p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.45;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 560px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-list {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 24px 0 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-list div {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #eaf5ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 17px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-list div::before {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      content: "✓";</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex: 0 0 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #04111f;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 1px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-image {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.26);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(2, 8, 20, 0.45);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .proof-image img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .metric-row {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .metric {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .metric strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 6px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .metric span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 13px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .apps {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 39, 74, 0.78), rgba(4, 17, 36, 0.86));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 20px 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 315px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card:hover {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      transform: translateY(-5px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.62);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-icon {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 92px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 92px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #f4fbff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #0a3e78;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 44px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 0 auto 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-icon img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: cover;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 19px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .app-card p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .mini-btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: inline-flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 0 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(141, 213, 255, 0.35);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--cyan);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 800;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 13px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-module {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 76px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(234, 246, 255, 0.02), rgba(234, 246, 255, 0.05)),</span><br><span class="ͼc">        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 30%, rgba(57, 197, 255, 0.12), transparent 28%);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #edf7ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123762;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      overflow: hidden;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 34px 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.42);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      min-height: 640px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 56px 52px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(237, 247, 255, 0.96), rgba(225, 239, 250, 0.96));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand-row {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-brand img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 54px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 54px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      text-align: right;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-product span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #526f8d;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 15px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 70px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.02;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      letter-spacing: -2px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #143f78;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-copy .condo-lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: clamp(20px, 2.2vw, 28px);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #2f4d70;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.32;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 680px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-actions .btn-ghost {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-color: rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.22);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-list {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item .mark {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: 38px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 50%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: var(--green);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      place-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-weight: 900;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(47, 179, 109, 0.28);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #133c72;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-item span {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: block;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #4c6583;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 3px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background:</span><br><span class="ͼc">        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(237, 247, 255, 0.4), rgba(203, 226, 244, 0.75));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      position: relative;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .poster-frame {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      max-width: 540px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.24);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .poster-frame img {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      object-fit: contain;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-proof {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px 52px 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #dceefa;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .condo-proof h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.08;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid rgba(18, 60, 116, 0.12);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card h4 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #113d73;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 21px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 10px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .profile-card p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #456281;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #123c74, #0767d9);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band h3 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 30px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 6px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: white;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band p {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #e4f4ff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 17px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .cta-band .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-self: end;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: #ffffff;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: #123c74;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      box-shadow: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin: 58px 0 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 34px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr 0.8fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-radius: 26px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      background: rgba(5, 21, 44, 0.76);</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 32px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.12;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-bottom: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip p,</span><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip li {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--muted);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 16px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      line-height: 1.55;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .contact-strip ul {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      list-style: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: grid;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 8px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .footer {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      padding: 42px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      color: var(--soft);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      font-size: 14px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      margin-top: 60px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    .footer-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      display: flex;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      align-items: center;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      justify-content: space-between;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      gap: 18px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      flex-wrap: wrap;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    @media (max-width: 1100px) {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .apps {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-grid,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-section,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-hero,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .contact-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-product {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        text-align: left;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-brand-row {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        margin-bottom: 28px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .cta-band {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .cta-band .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        justify-self: start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    @media (max-width: 760px) {</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .shell {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: min(100% - 26px, var(--max));</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .nav {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-height: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 14px 0;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        min-width: auto;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-logo {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        height: 48px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-name {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 23px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .brand-sub {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 12px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .menu {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        display: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .nav .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        display: none;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 42px 0 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero h1 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 46px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .hero-actions,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-actions {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .btn {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        width: 100%;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .trust-strip {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .metric-row,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .apps,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .profile-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        grid-template-columns: 1fr;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .proof-section {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 22px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-card {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        border-radius: 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy,</span><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-proof {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 34px 24px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-visual {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        padding: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy h2 {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 43px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-copy .condo-lead {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 20px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .condo-item strong {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        font-size: 19px;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      .footer-grid {</span><br><span class="ͼc">        align-items: flex-start;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        flex-direction: column;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      }</span><br><span class="ͼc">    }</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/style&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">&lt;body&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;header class="topbar"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;div class="shell nav"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Ir al inicio"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;img class="brand-logo" src="Logo_JVsys.png" alt="Logo JVSys" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="brand-name"&gt;JVSys&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="brand-sub"&gt;Desarrollo de Apps&lt;br /&gt;Audit-Proof en plataforma SaaS&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/a&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;nav class="menu" aria-label="Menú principal"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#inicio"&gt;Inicio&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#soluciones"&gt;Soluciones&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#proyectos"&gt;Proyectos&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#tecnologia"&gt;Tecnología&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#condo-admin"&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;a href="#contacto"&gt;Contacto&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/nav&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicitud%20de%20informes%20JVSys"&gt;✉ Solicitar informes&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;/header&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">  &lt;main id="inicio"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="hero"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="hero-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;SaaS · Evidencia · Control · Confianza&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h1&gt;Desarrollamos Apps SaaS &lt;span class="accent"&gt;Audit-Proof&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;p class="lead"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              Aplicaciones profesionales, seguras y trazables para administrar, operar y hacer crecer tu organización</span><br><span class="ͼc">              con información clara, evidencia confiable y procesos listos para auditoría.</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="hero-actions"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicitud%20de%20informes%20JVSys"&gt;✉ Solicitar informes&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#proyectos"&gt;▷ Conocer proyectos&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#condo-admin"&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="hero-visual"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;img src="mockup-condo-admin-saas.png" alt="Mockup profesional de dashboard SaaS Audit-Proof Condo Admin" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="trust-strip" id="soluciones"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;◇&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit-Proof&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cada acción importante es rastreable, verificable y comprobable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;🔒&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seguridad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Protección de datos, roles y control de acceso.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;☁&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plataforma SaaS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Arquitectura moderna, escalable y lista para crecer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;↗&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eficiencia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Automatización de procesos y reportes útiles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="trust-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="trust-icon"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confianza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sistemas estables, claros y hechos para durar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="section" id="tecnologia"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="proof-section"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="proof-copy"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;Control operativo verificable&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h2&gt;Control real, &lt;span class="accent"&gt;no suposiciones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              En Condo Admin cada pago, documento y movimiento queda registrado, validado y disponible</span><br><span class="ͼc">              cuando necesitas comprobarlo.</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="proof-list"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;Cobranza con evidencia verificable.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;Estados de cuenta claros y auditables.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;Documentos con respaldo digital.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;Bitácora completa de cada acción relevante.&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="hero-actions"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicito%20demostraci%C3%B3n%20de%20Condo%20Admin"&gt;Solicitar demostración&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#condo-admin"&gt;Ver cómo funciona&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="metric-row"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="metric"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;24/7&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Información disponible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="metric"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PDF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Comprobantes y reportes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="metric"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Validación documental&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="proof-image"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;img src="mockup-condo-admin-saas.png" alt="Visual comercial de dashboard Condo Admin con cobranza, reportes y estado de cuenta" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="section" id="proyectos"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="section-title"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;h2&gt;Nuestras Aplicaciones y Proyectos&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;p&gt;Soluciones pensadas para necesidades reales.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="apps"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;&lt;img src="Logo_Fracc.jpeg" alt="Logo Condo Admin" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Plataforma SaaS para administración de fraccionamientos y condominios. Cobranza, estados de cuenta, control documental y trazabilidad audit-proof.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#condo-admin"&gt;Abrir módulo&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;P&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;PENZIO&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Aplicación para planificación pensionaria Ley 1973. Cálculos, escenarios, reportes y acompañamiento digital.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;👨‍👩‍👧&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Pulungos CAI&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Sistema para control de acceso, asistencia, comunicación y administración operativa de estancia infantil.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;₿&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;BitMercado MX&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;MVP para operaciones P2P de Bitcoin en México con enfoque en reputación, seguridad y flujo controlado.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;911&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Mi911&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Plataforma de asistencia, alertas y registro de incidentes para una respuesta coordinada y efectiva.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;article class="app-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="app-icon"&gt;📄&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h3&gt;Plataformas Documentales&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p&gt;Emisión, recuperación, validación y trazabilidad de documentos PDF institucionales con firma y evidencia.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;a class="mini-btn" href="#contacto"&gt;Más información&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;/section&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">    &lt;section class="condo-module" id="condo-admin"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">      &lt;div class="shell"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="condo-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="condo-hero"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="condo-copy"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-brand-row"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-brand"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;img src="Logo_JVsys.png" alt="Logo JVSys" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;span&gt;JVSys&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-product"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;strong&gt;Condo Admin&lt;/strong&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;span&gt;Administración Inteligente de Condominios&lt;/span&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;h2&gt;La nueva forma de administrar tu fraccionamiento&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;p class="condo-lead"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                Control total, transparencia financiera y decisiones inteligentes con evidencia real.</span><br><span class="ͼc">                Menos discusiones, menos hojas sueltas y más claridad para todos.</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-actions"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Solicito%20presentaci%C3%B3n%20de%20Condo%20Admin"&gt;Solicitar presentación&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#beneficios-condo"&gt;Ver beneficios&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="condo-list" id="beneficios-condo"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard financiero inteligente&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Indicadores claros para entender cobranza, morosidad, ingresos y decisiones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cobranza con sello digital&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Comprobantes con evidencia, control administrativo y recuperación documental.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QR de autenticidad en comprobantes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pagos verificables y comprobantes consultables cuando el administrador lo requiera.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitácora completa del sistema&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cada acción importante queda registrada para fortalecer confianza y transparencia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;div class="condo-item"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div class="mark"&gt;✓&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                  &lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reportes y estados de cuenta automáticos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Historial completo por casa, adeudos vencidos, pagos y documentos relacionados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="condo-visual"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div class="poster-frame"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;img src="condo-admin-promo.png" alt="Promocional Condo Admin para administración inteligente de condominios" /&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div class="condo-proof"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h3&gt;Diseñado para quien necesita ordenar, cobrar, comprobar y rendir cuentas.&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="profile-grid"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Administradores&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Centraliza cobranza, reportes, documentos, comprobantes y seguimiento de solicitudes sin depender de archivos dispersos.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Mesas directivas&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Obtén claridad financiera, evidencia de pagos y reportes confiables para reducir dudas y transparentar decisiones.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;article class="profile-card"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h4&gt;Desarrolladores y fraccionamientos&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Profesionaliza la operación desde el inicio con una plataforma SaaS preparada para crecer por comunidad.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/article&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;div class="cta-band"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;h3&gt;Transparencia y control real para tu fraccionamiento&lt;/h3&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">                &lt;p&gt;Sistema operando con enfoque audit-proof, pensado para administración seria y resultados verificables.&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">              &lt;a class="btn" href="mailto:xve.montes@gmail.com?subject=Quiero%20conocer%20Condo%20Admin"&gt;Quiero conocer Condo Admin&lt;/a&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;/div&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">        &lt;div class="contact-strip" id="contacto"&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">          &lt;div&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼc">            &lt;h2&gt;¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?&lt;/h