<hr data-start="664" data-end="667">
<h3 data-section-id="kburmt" data-start="669" data-end="708">2. Súbela a GitHub EXACTAMENTE así:</h3>
<p data-start="710" data-end="737">En tu repo <code data-start="721" data-end="736">jvsys-landing</code>:</p>
<ol data-start="739" data-end="846">
<li data-section-id="wmbnco" data-start="739" data-end="763">
<p data-start="742" data-end="763">Click en <strong data-start="751" data-end="763">Add file</strong></p>
