<hr data-start="1084" data-end="1087">
<h3 data-section-id="glqgq5" data-start="1089" data-end="1102">4. Commit</h3>
<p data-start="1104" data-end="1112">Mensaje:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1114" data-end="1163"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copiar" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-d25c669f.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>ADD: mockup SaaS Condo Admin para landing</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1165" data-end="1168">
<h3 data-section-id="1l3fsej" data-start="1170" data-end="1227">5. Espera 10–20 segundos (Vercel redeploy automático)</h3>
<hr data-start="1229" data-end="1232">
<h3 data-section-id="ta6i4g" data-start="1234" data-end="1264">6. Refresca tu página con:</h3>
<p data-start="1266" data-end="1318">👉 <strong data-start="1269" data-end="1282">Ctrl + F5</strong> (muy importante para limpiar caché)</p>
<hr data-start="1320" data-end="1323">
<h2 data-section-id="3u1qdw" data-start="1325" data-end="1348">🧠 Validación rápida</h2>
<p data-start="1350" data-end="1376">Si todo quedó bien, verás:</p>
<ul data-start="1378" data-end="1450">
<li data-section-id="3zy213" data-start="1378" data-end="1423">
<p data-start="1380" data-end="1423">Una <strong data-start="1384" data-end="1423">pantalla tipo dashboard profesional</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wl48d7" data-start="1424" data-end="1434">
<p data-start="1426" data-end="1434">NO texto</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1viddcf" data-start="1435" data-end="1450">
<p data-start="1437" data-end="1450">NO ícono roto</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1452" data-end="1455">
<h2 data-section-id="7tyyv0" data-start="1457" data-end="1477">🚨 Si NO funciona</h2>
