✔ Laptop + celular → transmite <strong data-start="438" data-end="454">SaaS moderno</strong><br data-start="454" data-end="457">
✔ Indicadores → transmite <strong data-start="483" data-end="505">control financiero</strong><br data-start="505" data-end="508">
✔ Badge “Audit-Proof” → refuerza tu diferenciador</p>
<p data-start="561" data-end="608">👉 Esto ya no es decoración<br data-start="588" data-end="591">
👉 Esto <strong data-start="599" data-end="608">vende</strong></p>
